  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "70b05f1a-470c-9c9d-2040-574472bee6e7"],
 " identifies isomorphic states. Every state at one step of the chain rule is \
a path of the same length, so five steps reach six states:"
}], "ExampleText",
