  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "50637aef-2122-41f7-0011-73c950d713dd"],
 " identifies states whose edge lists are identical, vertex names included. \
The chain rule creates a new vertex at every event, so no two of its states \
