  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "286ae68d-79c0-1125-5869-ffd77875600f"],
 " keep a picture small. The Wolfram Physics Project rule reaches 45 states \
up to isomorphism in four steps:"
}], "ExampleText",
